==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Hokkaido Prefecture'''.
*Hokkaido Prefecture's base is a reference to the [https://flickr.com/photos/mark-fong/1159034830 "Boys, Be Ambitious!" statue], a bronze statue in Sapporo, Hokkaido of [[wikipedia:William S. Clark|William Smith Clark]] doing the same pose.
*Hokkaido Prefecture's base also appears in the [[Heartbeat Catcademy#List of Stages|Season 3: Field Trip]] stages.

